        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>WordLock Combination Padlocks</b>\r\n<p>The first combination lock that unlocks with a word instead of hard to remember number combinations.  Now you can set your own combination using words not numbers.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWordlock is the new generation of friendly, easy to use security padlocks for everyday life. Great for school or gym lockers, toolboxes, sheds, or anywhere an indoor/outdoor padlock is needed. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWith over 100,000 word and letter combinations and 5 easy to set, non-removable dials this all-in-one \r\npadlock is easy to read, easy to set, and hard to forget your personal word combination. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Easy to change combination:</b> Setting is a snap just turn the dials to the new password. No dials to remove, no extra wheels to lose.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/wordlock-combination-luggage-padlocks\"><b>WordLock Luggage Padlocks</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5 dials for 100,000 + combinations</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel shackle for strength and security</li>\r\n<li>Easy to remember combination</li>\r\n<li>Lock Body Width: 2 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 2 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Color: Pink with Black dials</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAvailable in 3 different colors\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PRE-PLS24-Pictures.jpg?v=1704354498\" width=\"400\" height=\"100\" boader=\"0\" alt=\"wordlock padlocks colors\">\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>This Item is Discontinued.</b> See available <a href=\"/collections/padlock-accessories-padlocks\">Pad Locks</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
